# Kandelo patch rationale (S13)
#
# Node's loader needs import attributes and source offsets that stock
# SpiderMonkey discards. Retain generic parser facts in the original traced
# ImportAttributeVector and stencil metadata; the bridge builds Node's arrays.
# A bridge cannot recover discarded parser facts without reparsing source,
# and the OS cannot provide them. Native vector tracing, retirement, dynamic
# attribute order and cached offsets remain qualification requirements.
#
# Source-only cleanup; not rebuilt or behavior-qualified. Retention remains
# subject to README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

